Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鬼当家 假期劫案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 我打到了17关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I cleared level 17!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 芬恩 没人在意你过来多少关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Finn, press pause for a bit, why don't you, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是很高的水平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a mega-boss battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么不看看那些雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look at that snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在加州可看不到 - 那可是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}= Never got that in California. = That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过了很多圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, guys, I have seen Christmas before,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这才是真正的圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is Christmas Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有冰冻的宝马 龙和骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the frozen tundra of "dragons and warriors, "
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个冰封的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are ice serpents that spew frost venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到真实的世界吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just keep it in the real world, okay, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢这里的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to love it here. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 不要总待在屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, no more screen time till we're at the new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拐弯 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn it off! - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 我们到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys. Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well? Wow. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你们觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, dad? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点让人毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's super creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 伙计 别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, buddy. Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 它不是毛骨悚然 它是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not creepy. It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is great, honey. Mwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 看看里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Wait till you see inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hon, you done good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们把东西都搬进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, it's gonna be so homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很温馨\N{\fnArial\fs30}once we get all our stuff moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all this space!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么付得起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd we even afford it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是有人死在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did somebody die in here or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人买到很划算的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}People get really good deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果再地下室不会找到尸体的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they find, like, a dead body in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人死在这 我们只是谈了个好价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody died! We got a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人搬出去 我们搬进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People moved out, and we're moving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这里闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.59,0:02:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者地下有不干净的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably built on an Indian burial ground or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们在后院掘土 肯定可以发现骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we dig in the backyard, I bet we'll find bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是在跟你开玩笑 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just pulling your chain, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, what was that?! Did you hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鬼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a ghost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是巴斯特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a realtor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 巴斯特斯 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Baxters! - Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just putting the finishing touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}on this little housewarming gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Thank you. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你们一定是小姐弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you must be the wee ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's the wee ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.45,0:02:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Maine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不善于打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not very good with real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喜欢玩游戏什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're better with space robots and cellphones and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会喜欢这里的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna love it here. I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是说你会把这房子要回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean you'll take this house back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不喜欢的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we hate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你们最珍爱的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just so precious, aren't they? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这是房间钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're precious. Well, Catherine, here are the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有问题 就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you have any other questions… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么问题 宝贝 - 这间房闹鬼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, what is it, honey? - Is this house haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹鬼 别闹了 它只是有个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haunted? Don't be silly. It just has… Personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎 休斯先生 - 很拉风的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome, Mr. Hughes. - Nice ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉我们要去参加舞会之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like we're going to the prom or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们能做的最好的了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the best we could do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯 这是杰斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hughes, this is Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她负责处理安全监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's handling the security and surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get right down to it, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们下一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is our next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个令人毛骨悚然的老房子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A creepy old house?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是任何令人毛骨悚然的旧房子 我亲爱的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just any creepy old house, my dear girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座老房子曾经属于吉米·库凡璐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That creepy old house once belonged to Jimmy Gravano,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个臭名昭著的走私贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}a notorious bootlegger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谐音走私
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去偷靴子吗？-走私？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're stealing boots? - Bootlegging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在20世纪20年代 这是违法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He smuggled in alcohol when it was against the law in the 1920s.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走私或偷靴子我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boots, booze, I don't care…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有报酬就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as long as I get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米被大家知道的有两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jimmy "dead leg" Gravano was known for two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一是他走私酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, his bootlegged moonshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.97,0:04:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二是他之前拥有一件无价的艺术品\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, two, he was the previous owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:27.62,Title,0,0,0,0,,…爱德华·蒙克的《寡妇》\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a priceless work of art… Edvard Munch's "the widow."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 辛克莱 又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, Sinclair, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我终于找到她了 - 你每次都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have finally found her. - You say that every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们闯入波士顿博物馆的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we broke into the Boston museum.\N{\rEng}\N{\rEng}当我们闯入伦敦银行的时候\N{\rEng}When we broke into the bank of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们闯入了秘鲁的骆驼农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we broke into that llama farm in Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是白费力气 我退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a wild goose chase to me. I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作有8千5百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth $85 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要的 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm in, " is what I meant to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in. Ah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信大家找到共同点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we've found ourself a safe-cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:05:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看在老天的份上… - 我错过了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For goodness' sake. - Am I missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不听我的劝告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against my advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我们最后的保险柜窃贼纠缠在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}she got romantically entangled with our last safe-cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 结果可想而知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it ended predictably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,言归正传 这座房子 正在挂牌出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, this house just went on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we hurry, we can get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在有人买下来之前就能进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before anyone even moves in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克斯特夫人凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Catherine Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看邮递员带来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what the mailman hath brought. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是去学了魔法还是怎么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get into Hogwarts or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是周末举行的假日派对的邀请函\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an invitation to a holiday party this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我新老板家\N{\fnArial\fs30}at my new boss's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的「地方」是指「私人山」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I say, "place, " I mean "private mountain."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋酒 精灵 圣诞老人…孩子们会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggnog. Elves. Santa. Oh, the kids will love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小明星录音机 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little-pop-star singing machine, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个孩子的时候就没玩过那个东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't played with that thing since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我爱你 老爸 ♪\N♪ I love you，daddy ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:06:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 你太调皮了 ♪\N♪ you're so annoying ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 离开我的房间 ♪\N♪ get out of my room！♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, you want to come on downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我和妈妈收拾东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and help your mom and me unpack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死都不去 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd rather die. - Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你玩得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死他们 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始玩游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, games already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kind of hoping you might want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起去看看新房子 怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}explore the new house with me, huh? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手队长现在在线呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain overkill is online now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和另一个小孩在玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry… You're playing another kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 在线上我们总是一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Online. We play together all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.69,0:06:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很酷 是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool. He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在现实生活中见过这个朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have you ever met this friend, like in real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他是你朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But he's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他了解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢用脉冲手榴弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He prefers pulse grenades.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我没问…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你有没有想过交一些真正的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, have you ever considered making some real friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？-兄弟 你得时不时地出去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Buddy, you got to get out of the house once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要接触点新东西 到外面去 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm saying? Try something new, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔离开你的大脑 你懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of your head once in a while, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pule grenades! How does he always do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, off. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩游戏了 帮父母干活 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more games until you help mom and me unpack, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了 要我帮忙摆玻璃杯的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done! Do you want me to do the glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.95,0:07:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你闻到了吗？-是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smell that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在加州可没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't smell that in California, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么清新的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's called "air."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都能闻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all around this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's a tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安顿好后\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about after we get settled in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I go camping, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个男人去做一次伟大的露营怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men, the great outdoors… What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你讨厌露营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you hate camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许我们俩都不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, maybe both of us need to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试一些我们不熟悉的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}try things out of our comfort zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西不应该放这里 帮我拿到地下室去行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you want to take that one down to the basement, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:08:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是放在地下室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起去 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就很划算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People get really good deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们在地下室发现一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they find, like, a dead body in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,如果他们认为《龙与勇士》的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The basement level in "dragons and warriors"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个充满鬼魂的监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a prison filled with ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 地下室在现实生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the basement in real life…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is just a basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂正在看着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dead leg is watching you."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楼下的灯光爆炸了… - 冷静点 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Downstairs, the light exploded… - Finn, breathe, honey. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一扇暗门 上面写着一段话老吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…And there's a secret door with a scary message.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是在警告我们 我们正在试着打开行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it's warning us! We are trying to unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白 但… - 芬恩 出去玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, I know, but… - Look, Finn, go outside and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会好的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔壁有个男孩 你可以和他一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-There's a boy next door that you can play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想认识生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want to meet anyone new.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可以上去玩游戏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just go upstairs and play my game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 你是想告诉我你不敢穿过院子去见朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, are you trying to tell me you're afraid to cross the yard and meet a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道和他说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would we even talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就问问他平常玩些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, ask him what he likes to do for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, guys, I am so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 这里有什么好玩的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, what do you like to do for fun around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,像堆雪人 捏雪球 滑雪梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, build snowmen, make snowballs, go snow-sledding,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,造雪地板 滑雪 做雪玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}design snow forts, go snow skiing, make snow angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩雪橇 穿雪靴\N{\fnArial\fs30}start a snow avalanche, wear snow shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩雪地做迷藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}play "hide and go snow"…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经说过「堆雪球」了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I already say "make snowballs"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么没有雪的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, but isn't there anything that doesn't involve snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做雪糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could make snow cones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以到我家玩电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could come over to my place for video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有「机器人步兵3」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have "Robo Infantry 3."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有多人模式 你可以玩攻击机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has multi-player. You could be a strike robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuh-uh. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么啊？-你家闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Your house is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么上个人要搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the last people moved out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闹鬼？-是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haunted? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,门缓缓打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors creak open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯无缘无故地忽明忽暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights flash on and off for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在那里被谋杀的一个歹徒的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the ghost of a gangster who was murdered there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在睡梦中被闷死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was smothered to death in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是真的 是想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way that's real. That's imaginary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈很早就说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom said it was a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当到了深夜 他们说你还能听到他的声音…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but late at night, they say you can still hear him…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处走动 拖着他那畸形的腿在地板上走来走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking around, dragging his deformed leg across the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想报复那些想睡觉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for revenge against anyone who tries to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你一起玩 但是我还不想这么年轻就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to hang out with you, but I'm too young to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼在看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dead leg is watching."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计 关掉电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, big guy, turn off the video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,关灯睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我就一关就通关了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… but can't I do… Can't I do one more level?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… but… but… But… but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿宝贝 喜欢新房子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, hon. You liking your new room?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.57,0:12:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿掉你的耳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your headphones!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个叫耳塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ear buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这次搬家对你们很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this move has been hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么我们要来这里 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are we here, mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为工作 这一步对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my new job. It's a big step for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一直以来努力的方向 但更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something I've been working towards a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们决定搬家的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more importantly, the reason we decided to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你父亲和我都认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}was because your father and I decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给你和你弟弟最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we wanted the best for you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的 比如32g的粉色平板电脑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best, like a 32-gig tablet computer with a pink-sequin case?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,节日里有比礼物更多的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to the holidays than gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕的圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lame Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别这样 我们完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克斯特一家已经搬到缅因州了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Baxters have moved to Maine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是缅因人了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're Mainians!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅因… 缅因移民什么的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maini… acs. We're Minonians or…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个错误吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是为了一个没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I uproot our family for a stupid job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,会欣赏我的愚蠢工作而举家搬迁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where no one will appreciate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我们很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, we appreciate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你知道的 你会成为缅因州最棒的副总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know you're gonna be the best V.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅因移民从未有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Mainiacs have ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着我们从国家的那头搬到了这头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dragged us all the way across the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our children hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.61,0:13:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 阿莉克丝恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… Yeah, okay, yeah, she hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对他们的成长有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's gonna outgrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的儿子只想玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our son spends every waking minute plugged into video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是有点内向\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just needs a little push out of the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,害羞罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little shy, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有真正的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no real friends… Friends his age,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他年纪相仿的小孩都一堆的朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}friends who aren't space marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小到害怕自己的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared of his own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想像力太丰富了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just got an overactive imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处走动 拖着他那畸形的腿在地板上走来走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…walking around, dragging his deformed leg across the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想报复那些想睡觉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for revenge against anyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吓到你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to alarm you guys… Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我满脑子都是那个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but my room is totally haunted by a ghost murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？-哦 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变是可怕的 搬家从来都不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change can be scary. Moving is never, never easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是改变的问题 是生存的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about change, dad. This is about survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要睡在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to sleep in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's safety in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Honeybunch…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么大了 不该怕鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you are too old to be afraid of ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实生活中 如果不编造一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real life is hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人害怕的东西 那就已经够艰难的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without making up stuff to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你妈妈的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the boss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去睡觉没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, back to bed. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果明天我在睡梦中被鬼掐死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll both be singing a different tune tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩就不会这么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if an evil ghost smothers me in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back. To. Bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要一个人睡那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I have to sleep in there all by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得布置些捉鬼的机关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人小队 256号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robo squad 256,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开防护罩 启动扫描仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring shields up and scanners online.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器已就位 发现鬼魂立即开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons are charged. Permission to fire on all ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到你了 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在抓鬼 - 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was trying to catch the ghost. - Oh, for god's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用电击枪和帐篷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a stun gun and a tent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能排除吸血鬼或僵尸的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't rule out vampire or zombie. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:17:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再碰这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not to touch this ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这房子闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I prove this house is haunted,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该搬回加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can move back to California!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个傻瓜 - 别叫你弟弟傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're an idiot. - Alexis, don't call your brother an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… You know what, hon? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 芬恩…呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Finnie, Finnie, Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是令人… 印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到声音了 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was… it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 啊 你从哪里听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, uh, w-where do you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在哪里？怪声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where… where is it? Shuffling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有人拖着他们畸形的腿一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like someone was dragging their dead leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你看 只是树枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, buddy, look. Just a tree branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的树枝 就这样 - 哦 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all. - Oh. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这和我们以前的房子不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dude, I know this is different than our old house,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.45,0:17:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I promise you, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没有什么好怕的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have absolutely nothing to be afraid of, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人搬进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's already moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不能阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that never stopped me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等家里没人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just wait until there's no one home,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后… 再进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then… We'll strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家快吃吧 - 今天是大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, eat up, everybody. - We have a big day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们订了圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are picking out our Christmas tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一起装饰我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna get new decorations and deck our new halls together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？-我们应该准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How does that sound? - We should prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去的时候 鬼可能会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ghost could come back while we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 听着孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你从你的电子游戏中学到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you've learned from your video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是圣诞时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially at Christmastime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂一起过去 鬼魂还会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost of Christmas past, ghost of Christmas present,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂在我们的未来 为什么总有鬼魂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ghost of Christmas future, Marley's ghost…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么要准备圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why we're getting a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, uh, little-known fact…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有精灵都变成鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas spirit repels all ghosts. Now, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲一清理完车道 我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna leave as soon as your father is done clearing the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能需要一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this! I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我力量无穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我抓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can live like this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太业余\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小鬼 你在干什么？-在做鬼机关\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing, weirdo? - Making more ghost traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要证明这地方是闹鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna prove this place is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们回来时 你就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see. Then we can all move back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我只是在吓唬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的大计划是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your big plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到鬼 把他们吊在圣诞树上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrap the ghost up and tuck it under the Christmas tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果鬼魂想从地下室出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if the ghost tries to get out of the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we're gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果标志坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this wrapping paper will rip…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说明鬼是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proof the ghost is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的鬼可以穿过门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, wouldn't real ghosts just float through the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不帮忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理完车道完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driveway's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗？会很好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys ready? It's gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ Deck the halls with boughs of Holly ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 'tis the season to be jolly ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ Don we now our gay apparel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.83,0:20:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la，la-la-la，la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ troll the ancient yuletide Carol ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fast away the old year passes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ hail the new，ye lads and Lasses ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ sing we joyous，all together ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la，la-la-la，la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ heedless of the wind and weather ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船员回家… 我们会带着猎枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My crew back home… We'd roll in with shotguns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,和总统面具等一切东西冲进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and masks of presidents and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通常是罗纳德·里根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm usually Ronald Reagan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们滚进去 把门踢开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We roll in, kick the door down like,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你趴在地板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"yo, get down on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要动 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody move!" - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「把钱放进袋子 不然我就打爆你的头」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Put the money in the bag or I'll blow your head off!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太TM精彩了 - 为什么不闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How fascinating. - Why don't you just shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 嘘 嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Shh! Shh! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 姜饼曲奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gingerbread cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢先吃鱼头 然后是胳膊 再是腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to eat the head first, then an arm, then a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.63,0:21:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要明白 我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand this… My crew is expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要像幽灵一样偷偷溜进溜出我们的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}to slip in and out of our targets undetected like ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.89,0:21:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吗 休斯 你真的明白我的意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you "got me, " Hughes, did you? You really got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不意味着要像那样把泥土和雪拖进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't mean dragging in dirt and snow like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者吃他们刚烤好的饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}or eating their freshly baked cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.65,0:22:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎他们是姜饼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't care whether they're gingerbread men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是巧克力椰子马卡龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}or chocolate-coconut macaroons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力椰子马卡龙是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate-covered coconut macaroons were Steve's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up! Both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Just look. This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.71,0:22:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. All right. - All right, now, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 打起精神 加油 深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull yourself together. Come on. Deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一个视野好的窗户 把好风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go find yourself a nice window and keep look-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.22,0:22:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You… Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.73,0:22:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以喝杯牛奶吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a no-go on a glass of milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.07,0:22:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么也没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.03,0:22:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这正是那个老走私贩想让我们想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's just what the old bootlegger wants us to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？有时候 我都惊叹于自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sometimes I even amaze myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们要干事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ronald Reagan. You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开放你的思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready to have your mind blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold this。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不习惯不戴面具干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not used to doing this without the mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看呐 让我想起了… 斯蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, would you look at that? It reminds me of… Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.28,0:24:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？动 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Move! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha… I… I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许有人来过了 - 没有 不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe somebody beat us to it. - No, it's… It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.48,0:24:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所有的研究 我所有的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my research. All my planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.61,0:24:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有历史的交叉点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the historical crosschecking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的琪琪应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beloved Gigi should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的什么爱人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your beloved what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该有一所这样的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to have a house together like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.99,0:24:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起度过余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to grow old together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以给我回电话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please just return my calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 糟糕 我得走了 请给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap. I got to go. Please just call me! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.55,0:25:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报 警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code red! Code red!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.55,0:25:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.97,0:25:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报 暂停行动 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code red! Quick! We're compromised! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.64,0:25:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈和我去拿带子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your mom and I will get the straps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.06,0:25:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 你和亚历克西斯去后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, you and Alexis get the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.65,0:25:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 确保重量平衡均匀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… Make sure that the weight is balanced evenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.99,0:25:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 孩子们 我马上就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Okay, Alexis, Finn. I'm gonna come to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.95,0:25:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Ah! Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure you saw something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她站在窗户旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! It was right here by the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.83,0:26:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你听说过「哭鬼的男孩」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, have you ever heard of the fable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.71,0:26:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个寓言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the boy who cried ghost"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.67,0:26:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄坏了我的毛衣 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my sweater is ruined, you are so dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.75,0:26:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该检查一下看看是否有什么东西放错了地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should check to see if anything's out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.42,0:26:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩来这里 让我们冷静下来谈谈这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, come here. Let's calm down and talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.72,0:26:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,饼干少了几块 看看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cookies are missing! Look, look, look, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.93,0:26:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在早餐的时候有六块饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were six gingerbread men here at breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.39,0:26:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有四块了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there are only four!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.18,0:26:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都证明 有人不听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this proves is that someone disobeyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.56,0:26:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我说早餐不吃姜饼人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I said no gingerbread men for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.44,0:26:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啦 我设置的鬼魂陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look! My ghost trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.07,0:26:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂出来过 从地下室里出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ghost is out! It came from the basement!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.61,0:26:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that is actually creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.11,0:26:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要鼓励他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't encourage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.78,0:26:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 告诉他们没什么好怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, tell your son there's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.07,0:26:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我刚刚打了个寒颤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just got the chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.78,0:27:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没东西从地下室出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing came out of the basement!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.33,0:27:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you are acting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是对的 没有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. Okay, there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我去检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just gonna check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.09,0:27:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来 灯打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, I just got to turn the light on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.89,0:27:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,炒锅 我们上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frying pan, and here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.27,0:27:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.15,0:27:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.36,0:27:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.90,0:27:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.20,0:27:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 有人要下来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, look, there's nobody down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.12,0:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.13,0:27:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.38,0:27:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all。That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.43,0:28:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just a branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on，come on，come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.89,0:28:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们不能迟到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.15,0:28:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.15,0:28:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老板很守时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new boss is big on punctuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.99,0:28:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a move on! Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.99,0:28:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的领带是不是系的太紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to decide. Is this tie trying too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.45,0:28:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.83,0:28:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你觉得合适就好 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever makes you happy, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所关心的只是我能否准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I care about is that I arrive on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.16,0:28:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个穿裤子的丈夫一起到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a husband wearing pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Well, la-Dee-DA. La-Dee-DA.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.01,0:28:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去圣诞节派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are leaving for the Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.35,0:28:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有五分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.97,0:28:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么没告诉过我？-我说过很多次了好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you tell me? - I did… many, many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.35,0:28:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新老板 山间小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new boss, the mountain lodge,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.19,0:28:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,颂歌 蛋奶酒…有什么印象吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}caroling, eggnog… Any of that ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昨天参加过一次了 不想再去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had fun yesterday. Do we really have to do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.99,0:28:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 我在叫你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? I've been calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.12,0:29:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关掉它 - 最后一关了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn it off. - Just one more level, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我就快胜利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I'm so close to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.50,0:29:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就快完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I'm almost done. I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not open for discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, no! Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.09,0:29:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经打到他的基地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to demolish captain overkill's armored base!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.64,0:29:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不听话明天都不许玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure that can be demolished tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.18,0:29:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hurry up. We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.51,0:29:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们不自己去呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just go without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.47,0:29:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是酒会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is not a root canal or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是圣诞聚会 应该有孩子去玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Christmas party. There'll be other kids there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.40,0:29:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和他们说话 然后他们会问我问题 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'll have to talk to, and then they'll ask me questions, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.73,0:29:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须唱歌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will I have to sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.74,0:29:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你对新的环境有恐惧症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you're afraid of new situations,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.57,0:29:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我拒绝抚养\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I refuse to raise a kid who's afraid of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.82,0:29:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天对着屏幕胆小如鼠的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that isn't on a video screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.37,0:29:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上鞋子 我去收拾你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on your shoes. I'm gonna murder your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.71,0:29:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.25,0:29:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拿走了我的耳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody took my "headphones."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.09,0:29:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.55,0:30:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 家庭宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Family announcement!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.68,0:30:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会搬回加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not moving back to California…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.72,0:30:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because of ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.35,0:30:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为青少年的叛逆行为 从来都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}not because of poorly conceived acts of teenage rebellion, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.77,0:30:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要学会爱上这个古色古香的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all going to learn to love this quaint little town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个恐怖的大房子 因为我们必须这么做 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this big creepy house because we have to, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.27,0:30:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拖着我们穿越整个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad enough you dragged us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.61,0:30:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经够糟糕的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way across the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.40,0:30:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要带着微笑到处游行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we've got to parade around with smiles on our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.61,0:30:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了不让你感到内疚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so that you don't feel guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.36,0:30:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 那么 你宁愿…不去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? You'd rather… not go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆在房间里是你想要的？-完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay home? Is that what you want? - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.74,0:30:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不是一直在你们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I might actually like this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我真的会喜欢这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I wasn't around you guys all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.50,0:30:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.58,0:30:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two can stay here while your dad and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.08,0:30:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去享受圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}have all the Christmas fun we can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.96,0:30:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？-是的 你们想待在家 那就呆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Yeah. You want to stay home, stay home!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.51,0:30:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are some terms and conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.34,0:30:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要照看弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, Alexis, you are babysitting Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold on. Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能玩游戏 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And no video games. - Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.48,0:30:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能玩游戏 不能听音乐 不能看电视 不能玩手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No games. No TV. No music. No phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.98,0:30:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好把电话留给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably want to leave her the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.61,0:31:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的规矩是不允许有手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my rules. No phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.11,0:31:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有紧急情况呢？-谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Emergencies. - Thank you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.40,0:31:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机只能紧急情况用 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, phone for emergencies only.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.90,0:31:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.45,0:31:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴大家各取所需\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am glad everyone got what they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.99,0:31:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受不属于这个家庭的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys… Have fun not being part of this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.66,0:31:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.00,0:31:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 我们会在派对上打电话给你们 别捣蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, we'll call you from the party. Behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.18,0:31:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从没让妈妈这么恼怒过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we've ever made mom that mad before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.18,0:31:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,随她便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.56,0:31:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I guess it's just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能靠自己了 怪咖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own, weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.69,0:31:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不打扰我 我不打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave me alone, I leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.71,0:31:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 她拿了我的游戏手柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the deal. What?! - But she took my game controller!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.15,0:31:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.40,0:31:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在意 做你想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.74,0:31:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们俩在家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.04,0:32:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们是否单独出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder if they sell them individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.55,0:32:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.38,0:32:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去稳定一下我的脚踝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have to stabilize my ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.30,0:32:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.59,0:32:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是吉吉？这不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Gigi? None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.39,0:32:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？谁是吉吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Who's Gigi?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.14,0:32:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到他说 我喜欢的吉吉应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back by the safe, you said, "my beloved Gigi should be here, "
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想知道你在找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I want to know… Who are we really looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.44,0:32:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在找尸体吗？-过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we looking for a body? - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.69,0:32:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉吉是我的老祖母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gigi was my great-grandmother,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:34.08,Title,0,0,0,0,,如果你非常想知道知道 她就是那幅画《寡妇》\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you must know, she is "the widow."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.37,0:32:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.58,0:32:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.58,0:32:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华·蒙克被她忧郁的美迷住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edvard Munch was so enraptured by her doleful beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把她画成了一幅杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he painted her into a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.55,0:32:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这幅画中 她看到她和孩子们坐在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the painting, she's seen sitting with her children.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.43,0:32:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的家人 我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her family. My family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.39,0:32:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,画布几十年前被偷了 但我要找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The canvas was stolen decades ago, but I'm gonna find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.27,0:33:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅画属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.81,0:33:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧宝贝 ？-当然 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, sweetie? - Sure. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.40,0:33:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还握着游戏手柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're still holding Finn's controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.45,0:33:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.49,0:33:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.79,0:33:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全同意鼓励芬恩走出房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'm all for pushing Finn out of the nest a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.37,0:33:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们真的应该把他单独留在家里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but should we really leave him home alone in a new place?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个新地方？-你知道吗 过几个钟头 就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what? - A few hours away will be nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.46,0:33:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们会学到一些关于责任的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, hey, maybe they'll learn a thing or two about responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.68,0:33:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.72,0:33:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ Deck the halls with boughs of Holly ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.47,0:33:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 跳起来 我在沙发上乱跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm! Jumping! On! The! Sofa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.77,0:33:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,关我毛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I! Don't! Care!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ …la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.65,0:33:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ Don we now our gay apparel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.61,0:33:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在吃垃圾食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm eating junk food!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.86,0:33:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,关我毛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.49,0:33:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ Fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.99,0:33:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.49,0:33:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打坏了灯罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke a lamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:33:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,关我毛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.41,0:34:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是巴克斯特的造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name is Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.21,0:34:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩巴克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.08,0:34:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ …la-la-la，la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.26,0:34:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ while I tell of yuletide treasure ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.68,0:34:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.51,0:34:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人小队256\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robo squad 256,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.66,0:34:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好潜入核心了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you ready to infiltrate the core?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.95,0:34:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始 三二一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boosters engaged in three… two… one…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.54,0:34:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Att-a-a-a-ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.26,0:34:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.51,0:34:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ Fa-la-la-la-la，la-la-la-la ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ fa-la-la-la-la… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.31,0:35:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 看看聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Look at this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.57,0:35:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 很高兴与你相会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那些圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all the Santas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你们 欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.24,0:35:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的新成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our new addition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.08,0:35:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.70,0:35:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待会再见 - 卡森先生 非常感谢您的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you later. - Mr. Carson, thank you so much for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.04,0:35:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你现在是卡森家的一员了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course. You're part of the Carson family now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.17,0:35:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边 伙计们 笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, guys. Smile. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.96,0:35:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.76,0:35:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 艾伯特 我花钱雇你可不是让你游手好闲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Albert, I don't pay you to loaf about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.26,0:35:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我们可爱的新副总裁来杯蛋酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get our lovely new vice president an eggnog!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.81,0:35:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不好意思 这是我的丈夫 卡迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, i-I'm sorry. This is my husband, Curtis.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.65,0:35:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我是她丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I-I'm her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.81,0:35:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡迪斯 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Curtis. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.61,0:35:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.99,0:35:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.28,0:35:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我的男管家艾伯特长得一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the spitting image of Albert, my Butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.45,0:36:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.12,0:36:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 领带也是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the tie is the same, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你领带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I told you about the tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过接受这个任务吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever thought of taking on the assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.04,0:36:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,男仆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of manservant?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.63,0:36:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我还没有想过 不过我相信我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, I hadn't thought, but I'm sure I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.80,0:36:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有小孩 一共七个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have kids, too. Seven of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.55,0:36:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.97,0:36:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这可能是最好的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.55,0:36:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有那些握着小手的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those clutching little hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.39,0:36:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙们在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the little tykes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.48,0:36:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他们还在适应搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're still adjusting to the move, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.90,0:36:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们决定晚上把他们留在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we decided to leave them at home for the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.65,0:36:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Ah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.36,0:36:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说更多的是「毯子里的驯鹿」 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More "reindeer-in-a-blanket" for the rest of us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.99,0:36:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请了全国最好的长着大胡子的圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hired the best real-bearded Santas in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.99,0:36:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来为我们提供鸡…鸡尾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}to serve our cocktails.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.37,0:36:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来一杯 慢用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's one now. Dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.38,0:36:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.63,0:36:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.60,0:37:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.27,0:37:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's… what's happening? Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.23,0:37:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's go… no! No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.57,0:37:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not the batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.91,0:37:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给力点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, turn on. Turn on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.12,0:37:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.53,0:37:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.29,0:37:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.79,0:37:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.63,0:37:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.68,0:37:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.89,0:37:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.73,0:37:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nooooooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.75,0:38:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.18,0:38:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你们怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. So, how's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.60,0:38:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安静 没音乐 没电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is quiet with no music or TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.48,0:38:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure you are? - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.19,0:38:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一篇关于口红的文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}An article about lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:38.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,所以它不是《战争与和平》\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's not "war and peace, "
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我试着读它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, hey, I'm technically reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.69,0:38:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 芬恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And Finn?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.16,0:38:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在楼下和那个孩子玩棋盘游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's downstairs playing board games with that snow kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he is? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.45,0:38:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这里真的在下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's really snowing up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.79,0:38:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们够暖和吗？-是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you guys warm enough? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用每五分钟就一个电话检查我们在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to call to check up on us every five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.71,0:38:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话是紧急时候才打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The phone is for emergency use only."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.38,0:38:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和爸爸很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll text when we're headed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.17,0:39:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you. Love you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.51,0:39:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以帮我一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 占用你十秒钟的时间 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It will take you 10 seconds. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.93,0:39:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给你买电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get your dumb battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.39,0:39:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我要去逛商场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm gonna go check out the mall,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.39,0:39:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能告诉妈妈我出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't tell mom I went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.02,0:39:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成交？-成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deal? - Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.53,0:39:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.11,0:39:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要胆小得像只小鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be such a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.87,0:39:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你会以为这里有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think a ghost lives down here, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.91,0:39:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我找到了鬼的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I found the ghost's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.83,0:39:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.51,0:39:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.85,0:39:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看呐 以前是关着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! This was locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.39,0:39:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了 一定是鬼打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried it! A ghost must've opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.10,0:39:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想吓我 行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're trying to scare me, it's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.94,0:40:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去里面没东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It probably only looks empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.69,0:40:05.63,Title,0,0,0,0,,在《机器人步兵2》中 你可以找到弹药室\N{\fnArial\fs30}In "Robo Infantry 2, " you could find ammo rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.65,0:40:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里看起来没东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that looked empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.86,0:40:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们会有一扇秘密的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they would have a secret door.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.20,0:40:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么愚蠢的电子游戏 失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't some stupid video game, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有什么密门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no secret door.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.58,0:40:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.04,0:40:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.96,0:40:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说过密室里经常有陷阱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention that the secret rooms were often booby trapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.75,0:40:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is totally cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.14,0:40:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.43,0:40:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前看到过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, well, we've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.40,0:40:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈论一个令人毛骨悚然的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about a creepy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.90,0:40:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Wait, wait. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.90,0:40:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:41:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这个老人的眼睛 她在看我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look at the old woman's eyes. Like she's watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 她在看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, she's… She's watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.51,0:41:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 我是开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo! It was a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.03,0:41:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.37,0:41:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.95,0:41:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触我的亡灵 你会后悔的 —畸形的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Touch my hooch and regret it. —Dead leg."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.05,0:41:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.01,0:41:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.77,0:42:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 哦 电话 电话 电话 电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! Oh, phone, phone, phone, phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.15,0:42:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.73,0:42:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 我关在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn! I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.98,0:42:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门啊 芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door! Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.69,0:42:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.90,0:42:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 你听得到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.82,0:42:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.83,0:42:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.59,0:42:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧 你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we ditch this shindig?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.18,0:42:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们得花点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's gonna take us a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.89,0:42:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能在这种天气下下山\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get back down the mountain in this weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.97,0:42:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.18,0:42:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在睡觉前到家 以防芬恩害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get home before bedtime in case Finn is scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.10,0:42:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.90,0:42:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的主意 等着你和他们道别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. So, you, my dear, say your goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.53,0:42:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 朋友们 我要告辞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, everyone! I will… Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.20,0:42:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好消息 也有坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's good news and bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.41,0:43:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是 有一点小风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad news is that this little winter storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.29,0:43:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}has picked up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.92,0:43:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以所有下山的路都被临时关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all roads leading down the mountain will be temporarily closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.05,0:43:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.26,0:43:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要封多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.72,0:43:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好问题 卡拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question, Carla.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.89,0:43:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我是凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's Catherine, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.14,0:43:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣布一下 卡拉是新的副总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those in the back, Carla Baxter, our new V.P…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.94,0:43:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问我们预计道路关闭多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has asked how long we expect the roads to be shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.82,0:43:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.91,0:43:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但好消息是还有更多的成人蛋酒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the good news is there's plenty more adult eggnog,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.04,0:43:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把他们拿来 圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right? Go get them, Santas.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.08,0:43:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.10,0:44:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.44,0:44:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 我在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Finn, I'm downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.19,0:44:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁建了这样的房子？这太差劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who builds a house like this? This is so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.65,0:44:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在自言自语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.61,0:44:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.12,0:44:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去逛商场了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-Did you leave yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.54,0:44:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gonna be stuck here a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.96,0:44:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冻披萨在冰箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Frozen pizza in freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.30,0:44:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上10点记得让芬恩睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure Finn in bed by 10:00 P.M."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.47,0:44:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.17,0:44:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}回复：一切都很酷 祝你们开心 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.27,0:44:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.14,0:44:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们只能尽力而为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I guess we'll just have to make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.15,0:44:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…我给你拿一杯蛋酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll get you an eggnog.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这一次 你永远赢不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time! You'll never beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.57,0:45:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你的脉冲手榴弹用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You were out of pulse grenades!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.21,0:45:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.44,0:45:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}接受聊天请求？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.09,0:45:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经打败我无数次了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've beaten me like a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.39,0:45:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you always do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.89,0:45:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是安迪？-谁是安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this Andy? - Who's Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.22,0:45:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你多大了？-十岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. How old are you, dude? - 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.19,0:45:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是另一个和我一起玩的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I thought you were this other guy I play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.98,0:45:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我早知道你还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had known you were just a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.52,0:45:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀你那么多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have overkilled you so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.28,0:45:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if I'm 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.86,0:45:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你玩得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you rock, dude. You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要学会保存弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just need to learn to conserve your ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道「保存」这个词是什么意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what the word "conserve" means?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.99,0:45:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是小孩 但不是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 10. I'm not an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.04,0:45:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么达到专业级的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did you get so good? Practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.95,0:45:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要每天花10到14个小时玩游戏就可以了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to devote 10 to 14 hours a day to the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.25,0:45:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,优先级\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know? Priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.79,0:45:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈每天只让我玩一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents only let me play for an hour a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your problem right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.01,0:45:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我喜欢独居\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live alone, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.05,0:46:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以白天黑夜的玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can play video games all day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.05,0:46:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后也没人叫你把房间整理干净？-是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and no one ever tells you to clean up your room? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.01,0:46:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几乎是上大学最好的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty much the best thing about going to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.97,0:46:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.64,0:46:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我想要一个新的「机器步兵」扩展包作为圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I asked for the new "Robo" expansion pack for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么圣诞礼物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.44,0:46:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 当我不和家人住在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't really do the whole Christmas thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.19,0:46:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不怎么过圣诞节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I don't live with my folks anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.82,0:46:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你不打算去拜访他们了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're not gonna visit them?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.57,0:46:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 反正我现在也没有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. I don't really have, you know, the cash to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.07,0:46:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去买飞机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}on plane tickets right now anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.91,0:46:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你没有过圣诞节？-噢 他们会给我寄点啥给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you don't get Christmas? - Oh, they'll send me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.04,0:46:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你独自一人 这不是真正的圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're alone, it's not really Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.00,0:46:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前从来没有这样想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought about it like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.59,0:46:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会陪你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, I'll keep you company.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.26,0:46:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想再来一局吗？-当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want to play again? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.51,0:46:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,=让我给你一些建议 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll even give you some pointers. - Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.18,0:46:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦哦 - 你怎么了要下线了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh what? You got to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.02,0:46:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信鬼魂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.52,0:46:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 我相信这个世界有很多奥秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, I believe this plane of existence has many mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.57,0:47:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这只是个插曲 只是个插曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's just a branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.78,0:47:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个插曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.33,0:47:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.17,0:47:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,畸形的腿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.81,0:47:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 周围没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the perimeter's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.23,0:47:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有动静 - 不错 好的 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No movement. - All good. All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.19,0:47:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吓着你 但我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I don't want to alarm you, but I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.20,0:47:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才看到楼上窗户里有人 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saw someone in that window upstairs, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.86,0:47:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个闪烁的 或者 我不知道 一个影子或什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A flickering or, I don't know, a shadow or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.24,0:47:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上有个人告诉我这个地方闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy in town was telling me this place is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.66,0:47:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个偷了你曾祖母照片的家伙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gangster who stole your great granny's picture…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.54,0:47:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这所房子里被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got murdered in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.00,0:47:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉我们那部分 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left that part out, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.92,0:47:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他不想让任何人碰他的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he doesn't want anyone to touch his painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.34,0:48:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有一些鼠尾草 我听说可以驱鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if we had some sage, we could cleanse the house out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.34,0:48:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.17,0:48:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想惹怒某个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to upset some ghost gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.88,0:48:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不管有没有鬼我们都要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're going in. Ghost or no ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.01,0:48:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 拿上你的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on. Let's go get your tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.18,0:48:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.06,0:48:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 还能听见我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, can you still hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.18,0:48:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鬼魂 他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the ghost. He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.35,0:48:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在有线电视上看恐怖电影了吗？-我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you watch a scary movie on cable or something? - What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.86,0:48:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么 不要熬夜看限制级电影电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do, do not stay up late and watch r-rated movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like a good idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.03,0:48:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能不去看那些东西 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't UN-see that stuff, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.20,0:48:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得做点什么才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.70,0:48:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在被子下面有时也有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding under the blankets sometimes works.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.29,0:48:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这建议一点用都没有 我一会儿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not helping. Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.63,0:48:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你说过他们去参加圣诞晚会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said they were at a Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.14,0:48:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鬼啊 是鬼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the ghost! It's the ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.06,0:48:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的 哦 我知道是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not possible. Oh, I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.98,0:49:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只是一个安全装置… 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a security device… That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.61,0:49:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们没有都去参加聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe they didn't all go to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.40,0:49:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.90,0:49:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 圣诞老人 小精灵 蛋奶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Santa Claus, elves, eggnog.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.41,0:49:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 小城镇里的人…他们喜欢这种狗屁派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people in small towns… They love that kind of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.45,0:49:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我感觉应该是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm getting a ghosty feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.66,0:49:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm feeling it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 根本没有什么鬼魂 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there are no ghosts, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.46,0:49:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再吓自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, god. Listen to yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.63,0:49:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.17,0:49:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会半夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm not walking into a haunted house.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.55,0:49:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,进鬼屋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.01,0:49:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.51,0:49:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脖子后面开始发冷了 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting these chills on the back of my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.97,0:49:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撤退… - 快点回来 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Code red! Code red! - Come back here! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.61,0:49:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.78,0:49:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.58,0:49:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.70,0:50:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.12,0:50:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.63,0:50:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.84,0:50:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.71,0:50:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.63,0:50:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-Are you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.85,0:50:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.22,0:50:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸 芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad? Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.15,0:50:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.57,0:50:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.95,0:50:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.37,0:50:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.99,0:50:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我被困在地下室了 - 在密室里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm stuck in the basement. - In the secret room?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.08,0:50:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 笨蛋 我一直在喊你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, moron, I've been yelling for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.67,0:50:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在楼上的浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the upstairs bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.63,0:50:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你在商场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were at the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.38,0:50:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我现在是在商场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I were at the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.55,0:50:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸妈回来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are mom and dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.26,0:50:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们发信息说得晚点回来 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They sent a text. They're gonna be late. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.93,0:50:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里太恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. It's so creepy down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.60,0:51:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快点救我出去 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get me out… Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.52,0:51:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.24,0:51:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了… 试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, let's try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.24,0:51:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.46,0:51:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么能撬开保险柜？什么能撬开保险柜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What cuts through a safe? What cuts through a safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.75,0:51:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 她听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she can't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.88,0:51:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法把你弄出来的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you out somehow. I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.88,0:51:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 她听不见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still can't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.55,0:51:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.60,0:51:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好多雪 - 我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More snow! - I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.27,0:51:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和我一起做雪球吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to make snowballs with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.73,0:51:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个制造完美雪球的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}\N{\rEng}I have a system to make the perfect snowball.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.85,0:51:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时不行 我姐姐被在地下室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't right now. My sister's trapped in the basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.48,0:51:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要买点工具救她出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have to buy supplies to break her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.90,0:51:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, cool. - See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.77,0:52:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.35,0:52:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共2152美元71分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is $2, 152.71.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.94,0:52:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.49,0:52:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以刷卡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whom shall I make this out to?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.45,0:52:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只接受有有效驾驶执照的个人支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only take personal checks with a valid driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.79,0:52:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我一定是把它落在另一条裤子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I must have left that in my other pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.71,0:52:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,168元… 我能买到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get… For… $1.68?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.30,0:52:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,假日快乐 圣诞节快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy holidays! Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.47,0:53:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 小心点 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I'm sorry. - Be careful, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.85,0:53:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,匆匆忙忙干嘛你？火烧屁股了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the rush? Is there a fire somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.54,0:53:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一杯咖啡 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One Americano. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.50,0:53:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯加鲜奶油的南瓜摩卡拿铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}One pumpkin-mocha latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.46,0:53:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外加生奶油 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with extra whipped cream. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.36,0:53:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还是不想去鬼屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still not going in the haunted house, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.05,0:53:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个笨蛋要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna take for you two bozos.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.93,0:53:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,才肯去做我雇你们做的工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to complete the job you were explicitly hired to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.22,0:53:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯入一间空房子 偷一幅简单的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, break into an empty house and steal a simple painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.94,0:53:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.10,0:53:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除非没有鬼 - 加钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No ghost. - More money.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 加钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.19,0:53:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,加钱？你们不是在开玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More money? Oh, you've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.57,0:54:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么… 你… 你把垃圾和面包屑带进现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… you… you drag in filth and crumbs into the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.20,0:54:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放风搞得像个业余爱好者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you… you botched the lookout like an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.74,0:54:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们又想分更多的战利品？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you want a bigger split of the spoils?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.53,0:54:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.73,0:54:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你想要回你的琪琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you want your gigi back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.83,0:54:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们有协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look… We had a deal…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.38,0:54:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之二十五给你 百分之二十五给丁巴 百分之五十给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}25% for you, 25% for dingbat here, and 50% for me. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.30,0:54:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个协议因为鬼改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the deal's changed now since the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.76,0:54:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之五十给我 百分之五十给杰西卡 百分之二十五给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}50% for me. 25% for Jessica. 25% for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.60,0:54:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 听着 我们要把它分成三份\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Look… We're gonna split it three ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.51,0:54:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就不干了 和你的琪琪说拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, we walk, and gigi goes bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.07,0:54:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个铁石心肠的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a hard-hearted woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.21,0:54:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想帮我吃完我的雪堡吗？-现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want to help me finish my snow fort? - I can't right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.99,0:54:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个盗贼正计划入侵我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A team of art thieves is planning an assault on my new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.75,0:54:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一能对付他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the only one who can defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.29,0:54:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cool. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.00,0:55:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur1}战争与和平
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.18,0:55:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.06,0:55:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉克丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexis!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.69,0:55:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子没有闹鬼 我们被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house isn't haunted. We're under siege!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.28,0:55:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人抢劫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's being robbed!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.61,0:55:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的一个游戏 芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't one of your games, Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.20,0:55:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我之前对鬼魂的看法是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I was wrong about the ghost before,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.28,0:55:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是有小偷 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there are art thieves, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.78,0:55:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再胡闹了 把我弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop screwing around and get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.79,0:55:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者找人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or find someone who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.54,0:55:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 小家伙？需要更多的指导吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, little man? Need some more pointers?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.63,0:55:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家有小偷正在袭击我的房子… 我被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thieves are attacking my house. I'm under siege!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.63,0:55:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么游戏？-他们一直在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, what game are you talking about? - They're almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.51,0:55:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么阻止他们进来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I stop them from getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.18,0:55:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像个防御塔的游戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sounds like a tower-defense game?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.22,0:55:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如「机器人步兵3」的17级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like level 17 on "Robo Infantry 3"!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.85,0:55:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全正确 现在 你的角色的技能和能力是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Now, what are your character's skills and abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.56,0:55:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我擅长布置陷阱 - 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, I'm good at traps. - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.73,0:56:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要只设置一两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't just set one or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.48,0:56:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这类游戏的关键在于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to these types of games…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要错开你的防线 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stagger your defenses, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.53,0:56:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找出陷阱的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to identify the weakness in my perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.66,0:56:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,并完善它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set deterrents.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.99,0:56:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但要想真正取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but to really win,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.37,0:56:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要增强陷阱的功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need traps that deploy on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.33,0:56:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像你的脉冲手榴弹 - 你知道我的秘密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like your pulse grenades! - Ah, you figured out my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.50,0:56:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你有多少弹药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how much ammo do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.75,0:56:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我只能买得起一卷毛线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, none. All I could afford was a spool of string.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.42,0:56:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要玩这个游戏 这听起来太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get this game. It sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.55,0:56:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 那不是很多工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, that's not a lot to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.84,0:56:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以利用我的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can use my environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.72,0:56:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这就是这些游戏的运作方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, that's how these games usually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.52,0:56:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要跳出思维定势去寻找其他的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to think outside the box and find other resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.06,0:56:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以做到 - 当然了 我知道你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I can do that. - Yeah, I know you can, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.56,0:56:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个聪明的小孩我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like the smartest kid I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以弄清楚细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can figure out the specifics.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.69,0:56:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 嘿 如果你还需要什么指点的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hey, if you need any more pointers,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.53,0:56:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下节课会在网上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be online for the next…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.53,0:56:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,8到10年以后吧也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}8 to 10 years, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.99,0:56:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我爸爸总是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what my dad always says?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.03,0:56:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.70,0:56:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得时不时地出去一下 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You got to get out of the house once in a while, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.70,0:56:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受一下真实世界 这才是最好玩的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the real world… It's the best game there is."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.14,0:57:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.80,0:58:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子里唯一让人害怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing to be afraid of in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.03,0:58:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 哇 嘘 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.49,0:58:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.52,0:58:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么？这房子闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? The house is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.87,0:58:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个鬼魂知道我们来了 - 真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The ghost knows we're coming. - Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.91,0:59:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道鬼也会使用水桶吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did the ghost use that bucket, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.33,0:59:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.04,0:59:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧你们俩 都集中点注意力行不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you two. Just focus here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.71,0:59:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.17,0:59:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是一群二流小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not a bunch of two-bit bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.34,0:59:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会因为路滑就退缩不前 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna be stymied by a slippery walkway.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.01,0:59:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我走 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Follow me. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.31,0:59:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上卷车库门…最容易闯入的一种 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roll-up garage doors… Easiest kind to break into. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.03,0:59:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻利点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40,08,Default,0,0,0,0,,0，，-好像被卡住了 - 是鬼魂搞的鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's stuck on something. - Something supernatural?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.96,0:59:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 赶紧去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up. Go help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.12,0:59:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.12,0:59:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.73,1:00:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业一点行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop screwing around. Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.02,1:00:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西卡 周围看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessica, circle the perimeter of the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.52,1:00:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有开着的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if there's a window open.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.69,1:00:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 总统先生 到车库里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Mr. President, get into the garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.11,1:00:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子好像会思考一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house has a mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.36,1:00:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不像我之前了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Unlike someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.97,1:00:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,差劲透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lame.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.34,1:01:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.10,1:01:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.19,1:01:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进来了 噢我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.36,1:01:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过去把前门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go 'round and open the front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.13,1:02:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 快停下来 快停下来 辛克莱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Stop! Stop! Sinclair! Aah! Ouch. Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.33,1:02:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't afraid of no ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.33,1:02:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,派上了用场 鲁道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming in handy, Rudolph.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.14,1:02:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.44,1:02:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.86,1:02:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.36,1:02:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.19,1:03:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.03,1:03:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢上帝… 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.03,1:03:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.08,1:03:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.05,1:03:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在喜欢我了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like me now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.64,1:03:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.89,1:03:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被窗户卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house has got me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.96,1:03:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.67,1:03:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.46,1:03:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.30,1:04:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.23,1:05:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,艺术盗贼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Art thieves?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.02,1:05:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.32,1:05:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的防线把他们挡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My perimeter is totally holding up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.53,1:05:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我一直在网上搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, I've been searching the net,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.15,1:05:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但找不到你玩的这款游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't find whatever game you're playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.99,1:05:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.66,1:05:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我现在干的真实的事情 太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real. That's what makes it so cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样啊 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Ah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.46,1:05:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.29,1:05:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在告诉我你真的是一个10岁的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me that you're really a 10-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.46,1:05:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人被留在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's been left home all by yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.55,1:05:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又有真正的小偷想要闯进来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now real thieves are trying to break in?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.72,1:05:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.38,1:05:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐被困在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my sister's trapped in the basement right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.26,1:05:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.26,1:05:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢我的天 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.68,1:05:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得报警或者叫你父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i-I've got to call the cops or… or… Or your parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.52,1:05:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者杰克·鲍尔什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, like, Jack Bauer or something!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.23,1:05:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.77,1:05:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我觉得我不应该透漏我的个人信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. But I'm not supposed to give out that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.19,1:05:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 随便相信陌生人有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, stranger danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.11,1:05:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信陌生人有危险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stranger danger"?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.74,1:05:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是有坏人想入侵你的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people trying to invade your home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.28,1:05:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 第二波战斗开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go! Second wave.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.20,1:05:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.87,1:05:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.71,1:06:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芬恩 - 姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Finn! - Sis!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.09,1:06:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的防线稳固\N{\fnArial\fs30}My defenses are holding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.54,1:06:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他们是艺术品窃贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said they're art thieves,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.38,1:06:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说他们在找那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means they're looking for the painting,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.55,1:06:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说他们是来找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means they're coming right to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.63,1:06:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该报警或者给爸妈打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to call the police. Call mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.55,1:06:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者找大人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call an adult… Any adult.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.76,1:06:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.81,1:06:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your phone's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.31,1:06:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该先找个充电器给它充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should get better about charging it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.10,1:06:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.23,1:06:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还以为我是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think I'm a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.73,1:06:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎他们是不是把你当成圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if they think you're Santa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.23,1:06:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 就算他们抓到你 我还有B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. If they get to you, we go with plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.90,1:06:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划？你在说什么B计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "B"? What are you talking about, plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.24,1:06:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我阿莉克丝 我现在有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is Alexis. I'm busy right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.29,1:06:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事请留言 我会回电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but leave me a message, and I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.66,1:06:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是只有语音留言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still just voicemail?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.25,1:06:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.25,1:06:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听到他俩的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want… I need to hear their voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.25,1:06:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 他们已经睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what? They're probably in bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.46,1:06:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没接电话 现在太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why no one's answering. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.59,1:06:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 但是他们应该睡前打个电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but wouldn't they have said something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.80,1:06:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须却听到他们亲口说没事才放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I need to hear they're okay from their own mouths.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.51,1:06:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 我也一样 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. Me too, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.26,1:07:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了 各位 注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, everyone. Attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.43,1:07:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是好消息播报时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All good news this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.52,1:07:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.73,1:07:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该会在三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should have the roads cleared.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.27,1:07:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多四天内把道路清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}in three days, four, tops.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.78,1:07:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？这次聚会的紧急状况会解除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? This party emergency will pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.53,1:07:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔森先生 卡尔森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carson. Mr. Carson.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.78,1:07:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have any questions,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.53,1:07:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以问我的管家 他在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}just ask my manservant over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.45,1:07:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢… 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.66,1:07:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我不是他的管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't… I… no, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.83,1:07:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在这里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work here. Not… no. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.25,1:07:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 三天时间太长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Sir. Three days is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.29,1:07:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家需要回家 我现在也需要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have to get home. I have to get home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.92,1:07:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两个孩子 现在单独呆在家里 我联系不上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have two amazing kids, and they're home alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.21,1:07:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须马上回家找他们 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't reach them, and I have to go home to them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.71,1:07:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 所以我不管它是雪地车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well… So I don't care if it's a snowmobile.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.80,1:07:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是直升机还是… 或者喷火扫雪机\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a helicopter or… Or fire up the snow plow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.72,1:07:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要开着它回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.30,1:07:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一次聚会的紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… This is no longer a party emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.39,1:07:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个妈妈的紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mommy emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.64,1:07:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家见孩子 你理解我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go home to my kids. Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.64,1:07:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生 这比我的工作更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir, but this is more important than my job,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.19,1:07:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要炒我的鱿鱼… 那就炒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you want to fire me, then go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.90,1:07:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.48,1:07:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个斗牛犬 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're quite the pit bull, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.53,1:08:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧我有一个好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it so happens I have some good chums.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.87,1:08:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在林业局工作 他欠我一个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the forest service who owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.34,1:08:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. Yes. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.71,1:08:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.38,1:08:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 帮我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.34,1:08:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinclair!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.05,1:08:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯 救命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hughes! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.85,1:08:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.60,1:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊 拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.52,1:08:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look you look terrible. Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.35,1:08:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 帮我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.02,1:08:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓一条腿 我去拿另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grab one leg. I'll grab the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.69,1:08:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我喊三声\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. On three.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.07,1:08:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一… 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}One… Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.07,1:08:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, three!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.45,1:08:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀了我 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing me! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.70,1:08:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.46,1:08:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别TM踢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop squirming! Stop smacking me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.46,1:08:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.38,1:08:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.84,1:08:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别TM踢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop kicking!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.97,1:08:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥时候踢你了？上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?! God!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.56,1:09:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.94,1:09:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点开 但也要注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. Go fast, but be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.28,1:09:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克斯特夫人 我打电话是因为你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Baxter, I'm calling about your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.66,1:09:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.41,1:09:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我 我只是希望你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, but I just want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.78,1:09:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your son is okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.91,1:09:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.58,1:09:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.91,1:09:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他在网上认识的 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met online, and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.87,1:09:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？好像一切开始变糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Okay. So, that came out wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.17,1:09:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？怎么知道我的电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha… who is this, and how did you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.42,1:09:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我黑了芬恩的游戏账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hacked Finn's gamer tag,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.09,1:09:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从信用卡账单上得到了你的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got your info from the credit-card statement.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.13,1:09:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心他会出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried something bad is gonna happen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.76,1:09:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在威胁我儿子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh… are you threatening my son?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.18,1:09:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么？不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! What? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.43,1:09:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我叫西蒙·哈斯勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Hi. My name is Simon Hassler,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.06,1:09:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿被锁在地下室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your daughter is locked in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.85,1:09:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你绑架了我的孩子？-什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You kidnapped my kids?! - What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.98,1:09:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我知道这听起来很疯狂 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I know this sounds crazy, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.02,1:09:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给警察打电话了 你这个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm phoning the police, you sick monster!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.53,1:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me explain for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.36,1:09:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will ruin you!!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.45,1:10:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情发展超出预期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That did not go as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.62,1:10:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.29,1:10:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个鬼魂 我们激怒他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the ghost. We've angered the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.33,1:10:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.63,1:10:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法进去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find a way into this hou…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.96,1:10:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有扇开着的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a window open up… What…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.88,1:10:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. I'm going up. Help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.39,1:10:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 等等 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god! Wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.65,1:10:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拉 推啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't pull. Push!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.49,1:10:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想进房子里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go inside the house!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.90,1:10:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笨蛋 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You idiot. - Unh!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.45,1:10:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚怎么搞成这样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.16,1:10:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.13,1:10:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别压着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.01,1:11:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.68,1:11:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.10,1:11:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.02,1:11:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. What…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.61,1:11:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudolph.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.34,1:11:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.01,1:11:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有个人在看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's like someone's watching us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.38,1:11:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 该死
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.89,1:11:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.27,1:11:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.64,1:11:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,早点结束这一切吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.31,1:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.69,1:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.54,1:12:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.63,1:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cookies.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.92,1:12:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别… 别… 别… 别吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't… D-D-Don't eat it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.38,1:12:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.63,1:12:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要受到惊吓就需要补充糖分\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get scared, I need sweets.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.67,1:12:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个情绪化的吃货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an emotional eater.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.13,1:12:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 辛克莱说不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Sinclair said don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.39,1:12:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.64,1:12:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.77,1:12:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.11,1:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.23,1:12:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.71,1:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.18,1:13:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.23,1:13:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.78,1:13:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.15,1:13:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good. Very funny. Yeah.=
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.99,1:13:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.62,1:13:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.70,1:13:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.83,1:13:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不相信什么鬼魂 好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in ghosts, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 很不错的伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Yeah, nice trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.88,1:13:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你想让我相信有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Listen. I know you're trying to make me believe in ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.91,1:13:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你失败了 因为老子从来就不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're gonna fail. Because I do not believe!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.93,1:14:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁竟敢闯进我的领地 还不相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who dares enter my domain and not believe?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.35,1:14:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会相信的 我是真实存在的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will believe, for… I am real!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.90,1:14:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.74,1:14:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.28,1:14:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.78,1:14:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.66,1:14:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是畸形腿的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the ghost of dead leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.50,1:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.92,1:14:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会相信的 你会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will believe in me!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.42,1:14:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 我相信 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah! I believe! I believe!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.09,1:14:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaah! Aaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.86,1:14:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是什么鬼 你只是个该死的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a ghost! You're just a horrible little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.78,1:14:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.49,1:14:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.37,1:14:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.80,1:15:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点 快点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.35,1:15:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 进去 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in, get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.44,1:15:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move! Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.11,1:15:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet! On your feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.20,1:15:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… what…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.28,1:15:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子在哪里 孩子在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the kids? Where are the kids?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.91,1:15:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是在玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it all wrong. I just play video games.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.45,1:15:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.92,1:15:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.46,1:15:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过根本就没有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it was no ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.92,1:15:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个讨厌的讨厌的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that horrible, horrible…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.88,1:15:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.89,1:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 抓住他 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness. Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.06,1:16:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.12,1:16:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住了 抓住了 - 你抓住了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotcha! - Got him! You got him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.16,1:16:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.66,1:16:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Get him in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.29,1:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.00,1:16:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.21,1:16:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呆在这里看着他 - 我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stay here and watch him. - My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.42,1:16:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和乌格斯去拿那幅画 我们走 - 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hughes and I will get the painting. - Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.97,1:16:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 什么 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go on. - Wha… hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.14,1:16:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.45,1:16:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该知道我们会被大雪困住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known we'd get snowed in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.78,1:16:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,困在缅因州的山里 你不是和我开玩笑吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the mountains in Maine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.81,1:16:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的 我们就快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? It's okay. We're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.59,1:16:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好的 他们是那么聪明的孩子 - 聪明的孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay. They're smart kids. - Smart kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.74,1:17:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.45,1:17:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 芬恩你能听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.06,1:17:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你的B计划时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for your plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.08,1:17:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就要进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're almost here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.17,1:17:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- B计划 - 芬恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plan "B"! - Finn?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.42,1:17:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.76,1:17:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能安静点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you simmer down?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.63,1:17:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister's still inside, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.47,1:17:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她比我更会整人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can be really mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.80,1:17:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我们愿意冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Well, we'll take that risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.35,1:17:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说我没有警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.18,1:17:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好 给我把安全带系上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down and put your seat belt on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.48,1:17:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢我的天 噢我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.03,1:17:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.53,1:17:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？-是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello! - Yes. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.70,1:17:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我在等着你给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you would call.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.62,1:17:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意试一下 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm willing to try if you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.12,1:17:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我只是想告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, i-i-i just want to say that…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.04,1:17:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 滚开小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.63,1:17:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.20,1:17:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…斯蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait… Steve, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.08,1:17:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 小心我揍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.01,1:18:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行… 不行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Steve, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.39,1:18:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小怪物 滚开点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little monster, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.93,1:18:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不 不是说你斯蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, not… Not you. Not you, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.97,1:18:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I-I-I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.23,1:18:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你能… 让我解释一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, could you… Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.56,1:18:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold on a second. Wait, wait. One second.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.40,1:18:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫 噢 不不不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve. Oh! No, no, no. I-I…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.27,1:18:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我机会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Look, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.44,1:18:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… Oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.32,1:18:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫 等一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Steve, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.78,1:18:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.99,1:18:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.20,1:18:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在和我开玩笑吗？快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.08,1:18:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔的 小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna regret this, you little…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.41,1:18:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.45,1:18:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢 你怎么敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh! How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.84,1:18:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}没听清
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.34,1:18:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢不 你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.13,1:18:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.34,1:18:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.47,1:18:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.56,1:18:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, forget it. I don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.06,1:18:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂… 你以前撬保险柜的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you, uh, cracked the safe before,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.35,1:18:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有想过把密码写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}did it ever occur to you to, uh, write the combination down?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.23,1:18:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 就快搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! I've almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.61,1:18:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不用打开同一个保险柜两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had to crack the same safe twice,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.94,1:19:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次我把它写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll write it down this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.57,1:19:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防我们明天再来撬它\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case we want to come back and crack it again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.37,1:19:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我真的不知道你是在讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really can't work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.24,1:19:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是真的真的很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you're being sarcastic or if you're really, really dim.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.50,1:19:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我在说什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.50,1:19:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这桩罪案现在正在发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crime is happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.50,1:19:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是犯罪现场的实况录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is live footage of the actual criminals.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.38,1:19:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在缅因州\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Maine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.26,1:19:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我不是对你们的工作指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't want to tell you dudes how to do your job,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.97,1:19:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们离案发现场还有3000英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you missed the crime scene by like 3, 000 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.39,1:19:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢不 他们撬开了保险柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. They cracked the safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.60,1:19:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我们马上就要发达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am so getting paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.85,1:19:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再走一步 我就把它砸成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more step, and I'll smash it to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.82,1:19:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？还有一个小孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Another child?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.44,1:19:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是从这个地方的墙里出来的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they coming out of the walls in this place or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.24,1:19:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,从墙里出来的小孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children coming out of the walls?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.53,1:19:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的 看着门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not literally. Watch the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.07,1:19:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 年轻的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, young lady,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.70,1:19:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你惹了多大的麻烦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you any idea how much trouble you're courting?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.04,1:19:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this painting must be worth a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.00,1:19:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说一定值很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to go through all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.37,1:19:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一幅被撕成两半的画是可以修补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A painting ripped in half can be repaired.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.46,1:20:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一个小女孩… 就不一定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same cannot be said for little girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.55,1:20:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,开太快了 太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go fast, gotta go fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.93,1:20:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.55,1:20:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 减速 减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, slowing down, slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.55,1:20:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到钥匙了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.51,1:20:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.73,1:20:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.48,1:20:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我不敢相信你这么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can't believe you did that!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.11,1:20:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.32,1:20:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪有时候也很可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.69,1:20:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 现在你看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Now, you watch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.36,1:20:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去救我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.28,1:20:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 长官 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir! - yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.61,1:20:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 你在吗？开始实施你的B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, are you there? It's plan "B" time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.66,1:20:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.33,1:20:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始实施你的B计划…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.95,1:20:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很吃惊 他没能来帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you… He's not gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.58,1:20:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把画给我 然后没人会受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, just give me the painting, and no one will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.09,1:20:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我想象的还要漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, she's even more beautiful than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.79,1:20:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我觉得她太烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I think it kind of sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.62,1:20:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太烂？那幅画是属于我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That painting is rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.26,1:20:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家族与不朽的伟大擦身而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my family's brush with greatness immortalized.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.64,1:20:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是一个完美的记忆 装在我的壁炉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be a perfect reminder, sitting on my mantelpiece.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.31,1:20:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.60,1:20:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果你要保留这幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, if you're keeping the painting,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.77,1:20:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么拿到报酬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how are we all getting paid?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.06,1:20:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下再谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about this later.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.65,1:21:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我戴罗纳德·里根面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me put on my Ronald Reagan mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.78,1:21:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, sis!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.11,1:21:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 开始B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn! It's plan "B" time!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.41,1:21:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她给我 别犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me. Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.24,1:21:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.75,1:21:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! What…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.96,1:21:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.00,1:21:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.96,1:21:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.96,1:21:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她办到了 她办到了 耶-\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it! She did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.38,1:21:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她安全 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's safe! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.68,1:21:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 去啊 把门弄开 你这个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go on. Open the door, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.43,1:21:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会从外面撬 从里面撬我没干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I break into safes, not out of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.10,1:21:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许你可以试试… 假如你现在在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, maybe you can work on that… in prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.48,1:21:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,琪琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gigi.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.44,1:21:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.52,1:21:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, little bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.98,1:21:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个机关管用？-完全管用 非常非常的完全管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It worked? - Totally worked. It so totally worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.57,1:21:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 孩子 发生什么事了？等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, kid. What's going on? Wait…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你能帮我吗？我不能动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, can you help me? I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.67,1:22:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.93,1:22:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 行动快点快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.01,1:22:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.39,1:22:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位后 报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're in position, report.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.59,1:22:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 伙计 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on. Not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.62,1:22:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.94,1:22:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 孩子们 你们还好吗？-我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, kids! Are you okay? - Yeah, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.07,1:22:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们流血了吗？你们受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you bleeding? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.70,1:22:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们很好 我保证 - 我们很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're fine. I promise. - We were so worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.58,1:22:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so glad to see you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.66,1:22:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.87,1:22:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人都还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody okay here?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.54,1:22:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是还有两个坏人关在地下室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but there are two bad guys trapped in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.21,1:22:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？别担心 那下面并不可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? But don't worry. It's not too scary down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.42,1:22:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad guys?!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.42,1:22:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩 求你了 让我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, come on, get me out of here. Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.47,1:22:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.28,1:23:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也打算不去看杰西卡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you just gonna skip out on Jessica, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.66,1:23:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太没人情味了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cold, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.29,1:23:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我应该忠于我的老伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I should've stuck to my old crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.54,1:23:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到了我的琪琪 我把她捧在手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my gigi. I had her in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.92,1:23:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她已经飞走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, she's gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.34,1:23:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so get over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.43,1:23:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 我欠你一个道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.43,1:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你警告过我们你听到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You warned us you heard something,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.72,1:23:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we should have believed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.88,1:23:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have believed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.22,1:23:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我能够搞定那些状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It wasn't anything I couldn't handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.52,1:23:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在告诉我你不怕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to tell me you weren't afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.94,1:23:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was at first.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.61,1:23:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 丰富的想象力用在对付坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But an active imagination is actually pretty useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.65,1:23:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是吓唬自己 还是很有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you're not using it to scare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.49,1:23:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.61,1:23:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 阿莉克丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, Alexis?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.03,1:23:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.62,1:23:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个地方至少不无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, at least this place isn't boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.83,1:24:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.95,1:24:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定不会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.29,1:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室的那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}That painting in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.83,1:24:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,已被确认为爱德华•蒙克遗失的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been identified as a lost masterpiece by edvard Munch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.96,1:24:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, who?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.80,1:24:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙克 斯堪的纳维亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Munch! The… The Scandinavian guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.55,1:24:16.07,Title,0,0,0,0,,他画了《呐喊》\N{\fnArial\fs30}He painted "the scream."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.09,1:24:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… the… The what?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.64,1:24:20.87,Title,0,0,0,0,,《呐喊》 你知道这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The scream"! You know, this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.89,1:24:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.98,1:24:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 行了… 妈妈 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, you guys, stop. Mom, you don't need to…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.39,1:24:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 这是… 它是从博物馆偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it was… It was stolen from a museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.44,1:24:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.81,1:24:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,1918年 他们以为它永远消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1918. They thought it was lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.98,1:24:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在的价值 八千五百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is valued at $85 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.28,1:24:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦…等等… - 我的天…我的天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! W-W-Wait. - Oh, my god. Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.66,1:24:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有奖励吗？有奖励 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a reward? There's a reward, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.33,1:24:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是 你应该问 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, funny you should ask,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.37,1:24:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个发现者的费用 他们慷慨地给了我们这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, as a finder's fee, they generously gave us this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.50,1:24:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.00,1:24:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.75,1:24:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.42,1:24:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆四张免费入场券\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four free member passes to the museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.97,1:24:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,期限一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for one year. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.89,1:24:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,假日及星期日无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, not valid holidays and Sundays.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.01,1:25:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这… 是… 非常漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… that… That's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.81,1:25:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没有奖励？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? That's no reward!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.89,1:25:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们救了他们的名画 他们就这样报答我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We save their famous painting, and that's how they repay us?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.35,1:25:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们去博物馆？太扯淡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By making us go to a museum? Lame.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,物质的奖励其实不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This season isn't about material things.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.82,1:25:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们一家人安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about family, and we're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.98,1:25:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就足够了 - 对 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that is reward enough. - Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.40,1:25:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.86,1:25:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那几个小偷是几个州的通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the thieves were wanted in several states,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.87,1:25:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得到了这笔奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we got that reward, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.85,1:25:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,三万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$30, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.95,1:25:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 神圣的 三万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Holy… $30, 000!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.54,1:25:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 大家可以疯狂购物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Shopping spree for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.88,1:25:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Video games!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.51,1:25:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.51,1:25:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想谢谢你对我儿子的帮助 西蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to thank you for helping my son, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.01,1:25:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是给了他一点点小小的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gave him a little encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.81,1:25:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做的一切都是因为他的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.56,1:25:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉那天发生的恐怖事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sorry about the whole kidnapping scare.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.10,1:25:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说逮捕你的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the, uh, arresting officers, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.06,1:25:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你喷了很多胡椒水\N{\fnArial\fs30}pepper-sprayed you. A lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.32,1:25:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他们只是做他们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, they were just doing their job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.36,1:25:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想补偿你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, we want to make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.32,1:25:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn tells me that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年你没办法回家看你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't afford to visit your family this year.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.16,1:26:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. W-Well, yeah. Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.58,1:26:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想为你买一张回家的机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we want to buy you a plane ticket home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.58,1:26:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你可以和你的家人一起过圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can have Christmas with your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.25,1:26:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？这简直不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? That's… That's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.34,1:26:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, merry Christmas. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.80,1:26:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩游戏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to play?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.76,1:26:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.80,1:26:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.84,1:26:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了一把新枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have this new gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.34,1:26:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 酷 - 你得去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, cool. - You have to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.85,1:26:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你买了啥 伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you get, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.93,1:26:30.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,《机器人步兵3》的资料片？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Robo Infantry 3" expansion pack?!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.77,1:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.48,1:26:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多关卡 更多BOSS 更多在线模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}More levels. More bosses. More online play!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.03,1:26:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh. Is it… it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.99,1:26:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一台带粉色外壳的平板电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tablet computer with a pink case! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.28,1:26:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 祝我的新比特犬凯瑟琳节日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh."Happy holidays to Catherine, my new pit bull.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.49,1:26:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你为我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm glad you're working for me."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.75,1:26:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个应该是… - 哇…真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And they should be. - Oh, hon, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.92,1:26:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.00,1:27:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你和我露营还有钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy… Camping and fishing… You and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.43,1:27:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？-行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think? - Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.72,1:27:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你先玩什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna play with first?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.51,1:27:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.44,1:27:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 梅森 我们回来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mason. When we get back,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.48,1:27:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能告诉我你的秘密藏身处吗？-可以啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- can you show me your secret hideout? - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.48,1:27:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能教我怎么做你的雪球发射器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you show me how to build your snowball launcher?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.23,1:27:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.44,1:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信那些雪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this snow!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.32,1:27:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些雪真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow's pretty awesome, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.07,1:27:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我一直想告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've been trying to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.29,1:27:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
